{
 "profile_id": "kouga",
 "profile_name": "Kouga Local Municipality (Jeffreys Bay / Humansdorp, Eastern Cape)",
 "short_name": "Kouga",
 "_doc": "Kouga LM (Humansdorp/Jeffreys Bay) 'TAX INVOICE / BELASTING FAKTUUR'. All 10 cached texts are OCR of scans (production OCR will be needed; values are read from a scan). Header block ACCOUNT NUMBER / ACCOUNT DATE on the line below the column titles; meter row 'E <meter> <prev> <new> [E] <units> DD/MM-DD/MM' (a trailing E after the new reading = estimated). Charge table SERVICE TYPE / CONSUMPTION / CHARGE / VAT / AMOUNT: 'Electricity Basic' (charge = ex VAT -> other) and one or two 'Electricity Cons@Current|Old Tar.' lines (kWh, VAT, amount; ex = amount - VAT, summed -> standard); some months bill no consumption (basic only). Fingerprint: 'KOUGA BTW REG' + Kouga's own VAT number (present in all 10 OCR texts). IDENTITY x_elec_ex_id = Total monthly - Balance brought forward - receipts/interest - printed TOTAL VAT (the bill carries only electricity VAT): 0.00 on 10/10. 10 bills checked; site/tariff left blank (OCR property block unreliable).",
 "fingerprint": {
  "all": [
   "KOUGA BTW REG"
  ],
  "any": [
   "4070193497"
  ],
  "reject_if_text": []
 },
 "sections": {
  "electricity": {
   "start": "^[ \\t]*SERVICE TYPE[ \\t]+CONSUMPTION",
   "require": "^[ \\t]*Electricity (?:Basic|Cons@)"
  }
 },
 "fields": [
  {
   "fields": [
    "account_number",
    "billing_date"
   ],
   "label": "Account number / Account date",
   "scope": "document",
   "pattern": "ACCOUNT[ \\t]+ACCOUNT DATE[^\\n]*\\n(?:[^\\n]*\\n){1,3}?[ \\t]*(\\d{8,})[ \\t]+(\\d{2}/\\d{2}/\\d{4})",
   "types": [
    "text",
    "date"
   ],
   "required": true
  },
  {
   "field": "invoice_no",
   "label": "Tax Invoice No",
   "scope": "document",
   "pattern": "TAX INVOICE NO[ \\t]*\\n[ \\t]*(?:\\S[^\\n]*?[ \\t]{2,})?\\.?(\\d{8,})[ \\t]*$",
   "type": "text",
   "required": false
  },
  {
   "fields": [
    "meter",
